WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:05.333
The turtle followed Ringo's spaceship.

2
00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:11.351
Its big mouth snapped.

3
00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:15.491
"I thought whale turtles were friendly," PJ said.

4
00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:21.130
"This one wants to eat us!" Lucy cried.

5
00:00:21.131 --> 00:00:25.316
Ringo smiled. "It doesn't want to eat us.

6
00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:32.204
It wants to eat the boomberries."

7
00:00:32.205 --> 00:00:35.509
Ringo tossed a boomberry from the ship.

8
00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:40.394
The turtle ate it!

9
00:00:40.395 --> 00:00:44.251
Bot flew toward the sea.

10
00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:55.080
Ringo tossed out the boomberries.

11
00:00:55.081 --> 00:00:57.887
The whale turtle ate them all.

12
00:00:57.888 --> 00:01:01.795
Then it splashed into the sea.

13
00:01:01.796 --> 00:01:10.876
"That turtle was hungry," Lucy said.

14
00:01:10.877 --> 00:01:16.724
Ringo thought of the buried leaves.

15
00:01:16.725 --> 00:01:20.843
"The sandstorm buried a forest," he said.

16
00:01:20.844 --> 00:01:31.978
"That's where the turtle finds food."

17
00:01:31.979 --> 00:01:38.092
They returned to Lucy's ship.

18
00:01:38.093 --> 00:01:42.016
Wind started to blow again.

19
00:01:42.017 --> 00:01:49.610
"See you at Space Patrol," Lucy said.

20
00:01:49.611 --> 00:01:56.629
The two spaceships lifted off the ground.

21
00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:01.266
Strong wind blew lots of sand away.

22
00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:06.423
Ringo saw the forest appear.

23
00:02:06.424 --> 00:02:10.010
"Oh! It's a boomberry forest, Bot.

24
00:02:10.011 --> 00:02:13.258
They grow on this planet too!"

25
00:02:13.259 --> 00:02:23.732
Bot flew the ship.

26
00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:28.554
"I'll write my report on Sandstorm Planet," Ringo said.

27
00:02:28.555 --> 00:02:40.443
"I just learned a lot about it!"

